{"id":424,"title":"解答: 带乘法的嵌套循环（基础）","summary":"给出上一课挑战的详细分析。","tags":"","components":[{"type":"MarkdownEditor","content":{"version":"1.0","comp_id":"f33a69b1-5253-4281-9b00-a706a0dd4556","text":"## 参考答案","text_html":"<h2>参考答案</h2>\n","learn_status":"undo"},"mode":"view","step":0},{"type":"Code","content":{"version":"1.0","comp_id":"b741b7d9-cfbb-4ea2-8064-ab4466fe6cfa","title":"","caption":"","language":"python3","special_input":"no-input","entry_file_name":"main.py","content":"n = 10  # n 可以为任意值\nsum = 0\npie = 3.14\nvar = 1\nwhile var < n:\n    print(pie)\n    for j in range(1, n, 2): # 注意内循环每次迭代次数是不变的\n        sum += 1\n    var *= 3\nprint(sum)\n","time_limit":30,"allow_download":false,"read_only":false,"high_lighted_lines":"","runnable":true,"judge":false,"judge_content_prepend":"\n\n\n","show_solution":false,"solution_content":"\n\n\n","additional_content":[],"hidden_code_content":{"prepend_code":"\n\n","append_code":"\n\n","code_selection":"prependCode"},"judge_content":null,"judge_hints":null,"learn_status":"undo"},"mode":"edit","step":1},{"type":"MarkdownEditor","content":{"version":"1.0","comp_id":"b8fc2c4b-9d39-4bc0-ab9f-975ef6fe7dfa","text":"### 复杂度\n\n此问题中的外循环， 即**第5行**下的所有内容，`while var < n` 运行 $log_3(n)$ 次，因为 `var` 首先等于 $1$，然后是 $3$，然后是 $9 ,\\cdots$，直到它是 $3^k$ 使得 $3^k \\leq n$。 这意味着外循环总共运行了 $log_3(n)$ 次。 另一方面，内循环总共运行 $log_3(n)\\times\\frac{n}{2}$。 所以，\n\n| <center>语句  | <center>执行次数</center> |\n| --- | --- |\n|   n = 10  |   1  |\n|  sum = 0  |   1  |\n|  pie = 3.14  |   1  |\n|   var = 1 |   1  |\n|   while var < n:  |   $log_3(n)$  |\n|   print(pie)  |    $log_3(n)$  |\n|   j in range(1,n,2): |  $log_3(n)\\times\\frac{n}{2}$  |\n|   sum++;  |  $log_3(n)\\times\\frac{n}{2}$  |\n|   print(sum)  |   1   |\n\n\n**运行时间复杂度** = \n\n$5+log_3(n)+log_3(n)+(log_3(n)\\times\\frac{n}{2})+(log_3(n)\\times\\frac{n}{2})$\n\n$= 5+2log_3(n)+2(\\frac{nlog_3(n)}{2})$\n\n$= 5+2log_3(n)+nlog_3(n)$\n\n\n现在，要找到Big(O)表示的复杂度：\n1. 去掉常量$\\Rightarrow nlog_3(n)+n$\n2. 删除低阶项 $\\Rightarrow nlog_3(n)$\n\n所以大O表示的时间复杂度：**$O(nlog_3(n))$**。","text_html":"<h3>复杂度</h3>\n<p>此问题中的外循环， 即<strong>第5行</strong>下的所有内容，<code>while var &lt; n</code> 运行 <span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math><semantics><mrow><mi>l</mi><mi>o</mi><msub><mi>g</mi><mn>3</mn></msub><mo>(</mo><mi>n</mi><mo>)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">log_3(n)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.75em;\"></span><span class=\"strut bottom\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"base textstyle uncramped\"><span class=\"mord mathit\" style=\"margin-right:0.01968em;\">l</span><span class=\"mord mathit\">o</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathit\" style=\"margin-right:0.03588em;\">g</span><span class=\"vlist\"><span style=\"top:0.15em;margin-right:0.05em;margin-left:-0.03588em;\"><span class=\"fontsize-ensurer reset-size5 size5\"><span style=\"font-size:0em;\">​</span></span><span class=\"reset-textstyle scriptstyle cramped\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">3</span></span></span><span class=\"baseline-fix\"><span class=\"fontsize-ensurer reset-size5 size5\"><span style=\"font-size:0em;\">​</span></span>​</span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathit\">n</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span> 次，因为 <code>var</code> 首先等于 <span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math><semantics><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">1</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.64444em;\"></span><span class=\"strut bottom\" style=\"height:0.64444em;vertical-align:0em;\"></span><span class=\"base textstyle uncramped\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">1</span></span></span></span>，然后是 <span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math><semantics><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">3</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.64444em;\"></span><span class=\"strut bottom\" style=\"height:0.64444em;vertical-align:0em;\"></span><span class=\"base textstyle uncramped\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">3</span></span></span></span>，然后是 <span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math><semantics><mrow><mn>9</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mo>⋯</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">9 ,\\cdots</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.64444em;\"></span><span class=\"strut bottom\" style=\"height:0.8388800000000001em;vertical-align:-0.19444em;\"></span><span class=\"base textstyle uncramped\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">9</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"minner\">⋯</span></span></span></span>，直到它是 <span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math><semantics><mrow><msup><mn>3</mn><mi>k</mi></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">3^k</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.849108em;\"></span><span class=\"strut bottom\" style=\"height:0.849108em;vertical-align:0em;\"></span><span class=\"base textstyle uncramped\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">3</span><span class=\"vlist\"><span style=\"top:-0.363em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"fontsize-ensurer reset-size5 size5\"><span style=\"font-size:0em;\">​</span></span><span class=\"reset-textstyle scriptstyle uncramped\"><span class=\"mord mathit\" style=\"margin-right:0.03148em;\">k</span></span></span><span class=\"baseline-fix\"><span class=\"fontsize-ensurer reset-size5 size5\"><span style=\"font-size:0em;\">​</span></span>​</span></span></span></span></span></span> 使得 <span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math><semantics><mrow><msup><mn>3</mn><mi>k</mi></msup><mo>≤</mo><mi>n</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">3^k \\leq n</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.849108em;\"></span><span class=\"strut bottom\" style=\"height:0.985078em;vertical-align:-0.13597em;\"></span><span class=\"base textstyle uncramped\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">3</span><span class=\"vlist\"><span style=\"top:-0.363em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"fontsize-ensurer reset-size5 size5\"><span style=\"font-size:0em;\">​</span></span><span class=\"reset-textstyle scriptstyle uncramped\"><span class=\"mord mathit\" style=\"margin-right:0.03148em;\">k</span></span></span><span class=\"baseline-fix\"><span class=\"fontsize-ensurer reset-size5 size5\"><span style=\"font-size:0em;\">​</span></span>​</span></span></span><span class=\"mrel\">≤</span><span class=\"mord mathit\">n</span></span></span></span>。 这意味着外循环总共运行了 <span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math><semantics><mrow><mi>l</mi><mi>o</mi><msub><mi>g</mi><mn>3</mn></msub><mo>(</mo><mi>n</mi><mo>)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">log_3(n)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.75em;\"></span><span class=\"strut bottom\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"base textstyle uncramped\"><span class=\"mord mathit\" style=\"margin-right:0.01968em;\">l</span><span class=\"mord mathit\">o</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathit\" style=\"margin-right:0.03588em;\">g</span><span class=\"vlist\"><span style=\"top:0.15em;margin-right:0.05em;margin-left:-0.03588em;\"><span class=\"fontsize-ensurer reset-size5 size5\"><span style=\"font-size:0em;\">​</span></span><span class=\"reset-textstyle scriptstyle cramped\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">3</span></span></span><span class=\"baseline-fix\"><span class=\"fontsize-ensurer reset-size5 size5\"><span style=\"font-size:0em;\">​</span></span>​</span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathit\">n</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span> 次。 另一方面，内循环总共运行 <span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math><semantics><mrow><mi>l</mi><mi>o</mi><msub><mi>g</mi><mn>3</mn></msub><mo>(</mo><mi>n</mi><mo>)</mo><mo>×</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>n</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">log_3(n)\\times\\frac{n}{2}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.75em;\"></span><span class=\"strut bottom\" style=\"height:1.095em;vertical-align:-0.345em;\"></span><span class=\"base textstyle uncramped\"><span class=\"mord mathit\" style=\"margin-right:0.01968em;\">l</span><span class=\"mord mathit\">o</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathit\" style=\"margin-right:0.03588em;\">g</span><span class=\"vlist\"><span style=\"top:0.15em;margin-right:0.05em;margin-left:-0.03588em;\"><span class=\"fontsize-ensurer reset-size5 size5\"><span style=\"font-size:0em;\">​</span></span><span class=\"reset-textstyle scriptstyle cramped\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">3</span></span></span><span class=\"baseline-fix\"><span class=\"fontsize-ensurer reset-size5 size5\"><span style=\"font-size:0em;\">​</span></span>​</span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathit\">n</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mord reset-textstyle textstyle uncramped\"><span class=\"sizing reset-size5 size5 reset-textstyle textstyle uncramped nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist\"><span style=\"top:0.345em;\"><span class=\"fontsize-ensurer reset-size5 size5\"><span style=\"font-size:0em;\">​</span></span><span class=\"reset-textstyle scriptstyle cramped\"><span class=\"mord scriptstyle cramped\"><span cla